WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.775
The small gear on the motor drives the big gear on the winch.

2
00:00:04.975 --> 00:00:06.775
Watch the orange dots.

3
00:00:10.418 --> 00:00:13.768
One motor turn is only a third of a winch turn.

4
00:00:21.565 --> 00:00:24.540
Three times slower, but three times stronger.
